 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Double position of the pronoun in the progressive periphrasis",
     "texto": [
      "With the periphrasis **stare + gerund**, the clitic pronoun has two equally correct and equivalent placements: **Before the conjugated verb stare**: **Lo sto preparando adesso** (I'm preparing it now); **Ti sto ascoltando** (I'm listening to you).",
      "**Attached to the end of the gerund (enclitic)**: **Sto preparandolo adesso**; **Sto ascoltandoti con attenzione**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The invariable rule of the gerund with enclisis",
     "texto": [
      "When the pronoun joins the gerund, the gerund keeps its whole lexical form and the pronoun is added at the end, forming a single written word: **leggendo + lo = leggendolo**; **finendo + lo = finendolo**; **guardando + la = guardandola**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
